                        ▼
                 Django URLs
                        │
                        ▼
                     Views
                        │
              ┌─────────┴─────────┐
              │                   │
             Forms             Services
              │                   │
              └─────────┬─────────┘
                        │
                        ▼
                     Models
                        │
                        ▼
                    Database

Later the architecture becomes:

Browser
  │
  ├── Django Web Application
  │
  └── REST API
          │
          ▼
      DRF Layer
          │
          ▼
     Business Services
          │
