A professional project must be tested.

You don't want to manually test everything every time.

Important tests:

User registration
Login
Product creation
Unauthorized product access
Order creation
Order acceptance
Stock transfer
Waiting-for-stock
Invoice generation
Duplicate invoice prevention
Payment
Overpayment prevention
Ledger calculation
Customer invoice
Permissions
Example critical test

Invoice:

₹41,800

Payment:

₹50,000

Expected:

ValidationError

This should be an automated test.

Testing levels

You will learn:

