Financial Flow

The financial side can be visualized separately:

Order
  ↓
Invoice
  ↓
DEBIT
  ↓
Retailer owes money
  ↓
Payment
  ↓
CREDIT
  ↓
Outstanding decreases

Mathematically:

Outstanding
=
Σ Debit
-
Σ Credit
Inventory Flow
Wholesaler Stock
      │
      │ Fulfillment
      ▼
  Deduct Stock
      │
      ▼
Retailer Stock

Example:

Wholesaler = 500
Order = 220

500 - 220 = 280

Retailer:
0 + 220 = 220
